## Final report

1. Preserve historical `--ref` packaging support  
   `CONFIRMED` · correctness · `scripts/package-codex-plugin.sh:242`  
   The newly mandatory hook pathspecs do not exist in older refs, so `scripts/package-codex-plugin.sh --ref 36f3883^` exits 128 before packaging. The previous script supported that use case.

2. Centralize the source-only exclusion list  
   `PLAUSIBLE` · cleanup · `scripts/package-codex-plugin.sh:340`  
   The identical exclusion regex also lives in `tests/codex/test-package-codex-plugin.sh:166`; future additions can update only one list, leaving packaging behavior and its test out of sync.

Assessment: two findings survived independent verification. Review was read-only.

